","type":"Hail","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T05:42Z","county":"Gulf","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T05:42Z","endLat":29.88,"endLon":-85.22,"episode":189148,"id":1167810,"injuries":0,"lat":29.88,"location":"White City","lon":-85.22,"magnitude":1.0,"source":"Broadcast Media","state":"FL","type":"Hail","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T05:48Z","county":"Gulf","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T05:48Z","endLat":30.01,"endLon":-85.15,"episode":189148,"id":1167811,"injuries":0,"lat":30.01,"location":"0.69 N Dalkeith","lon":-85.15,"magnitude":1.0,"source":"Broadcast Media","state":"FL","type":"Hail","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T05:49Z","county":"Lowndes","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"3.50M","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T06:00Z","endLat":30.904,"endLon":-83.296,"episode":189155,"id":1167829,"injuries":0,"lat":30.845,"location":"1.29 WNW Remerton","lon":-83.331,"magnitude":65.0,"magnitudeType":"EG","narrative":"Based on storm reports and radar data, damage began near the I-75 Exit 18 in Valdosta and continued East-Northeast through the northwest portion of Valdosta. Within this area, numerous large pine trees were uprooted with a few snapped along the swath of severe winds. All trees uprooted or snapped were facing to the east or northeast, which is indicative of straight-line wind damage. Moreover, radar data from Moody Air Force Base displayed a distinct downburst signature throughout the duration of the storm in Valdosta. Examination of the photos and drone imagery from Valdosta Fire and Lowndes County EMA showed that in some areas, damage was extensive with widespread pine trees falling onto homes. In total, 32 homes were affected, with a few homes being directly impacted by pine trees, effectively sliced in half. Damage to all single family homes was due to tree impacts, with no damage noted due directly to the straight-line winds. Wind damage reports extended as far north as Lakeshore Drive. The path width peaked at just over 1 mile wide, mainly in the area inside Inner Perimeter Road. Based on the size and number of trees uprooted and a few snapped, the maximum winds within this area is rated at 75 mph.","source":"NWS Storm Survey","state":"GA","type":"Thunderstorm Wind","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T05:50Z","county":"Gulf","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T05:50Z","endLat":30.01,"endLon":-85.15,"episode":189148,"id":1167812,"injuries":0,"lat":30.01,"location":"0.69 N Dalkeith","lon":-85.15,"magnitude":1.0,"source":"Broadcast Media","state":"FL","type":"Hail","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T06:15Z","county":"Lowndes","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T06:15Z","endLat":30.91,"endLon":-83.08,"episode":189155,"id":1167834,"injuries":0,"lat":30.91,"location":"0.91 NW Naylor","lon":-83.08,"magnitude":1.75,"source":"Social Media","state":"GA","type":"Hail","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T06:20Z","county":"Lanier","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T06:20Z","endLat":30.94,"endLon":-83.0,"episode":189155,"id":1167835,"injuries":0,"lat":30.94,"location":"0.91 NW Stockton","lon":-83.0,"magnitude":1.0,"source":"Social Media","state":"GA","type":"Hail","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T06:32Z","county":"Liberty","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T06:32Z","endLat":30.39,"endLon":-84.8,"episode":189148,"id":1167813,"injuries":0,"lat":30.39,"location":"0.6 W Hosford","lon":-84.8,"magnitude":1.0,"source":"Public","state":"FL","type":"Hail","wfo":"TAE"},{"begin":"2024-03-27T07:37Z","county":"Mitchell","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2024-03-27T07:37Z","endLat":31.13,"endLon":-84.16,"episode":189155,"id":1167825,"injuries":0,"lat":31.13,"location":"0.91 NW Pelham","lon":-84.16,"magnitude":50.0,"magnitudeType":"EG","narrative":"Several trees w